Package: novapinyin
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: NovaPinyin contributors <noreply@github.com>
Depends: @DEPENDS@, fcitx5 (>= 5.0.21), libime-data, fcitx5-config-qt, fcitx5-frontend-gtk3, fcitx5-frontend-gtk4, fcitx5-frontend-qt5, im-config, python3, python3-tk, git
Homepage: https://github.com/pyaude/nova-pinyin
Description: Local-first Chinese pinyin input method for Ubuntu
 Fcitx5 addon with full pinyin, double pinyin, configurable fuzzy matching,
 bounded typo correction, local learning, dictionaries, traditional Chinese,
 emoji candidates, opt-in context ranking, explicit developer completions,
 user-selected project identifier indexes and a local dictionary manager.
